.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四、文言文聚光燈","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色代號（在文字層，顏色只有解 rStyle 才看得到），PDF p4 可見","n":38,"ssz":".........................1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀完了這一課，你是否發現到文言文經常有「一字多義」的特性，意思是「一個字，有多種解釋」。例如課文中的「少」字就是這樣。\n以下是「少」字的多義整理：","n":73,"ssz":"....1...............1.........2..11......................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀完了這一課，你是否發現到文言文經常有「一字多義」的特性，意思是「一個字，有多種解釋」。例如課文中的「少」字就是這樣。","n":59,"ssz":"....1...............1.........2..11........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以下是「少」字的多義整理：","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"多義字","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀 音","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"意 思","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例 句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例句解釋","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"少","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"Ａ稍微","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"旅店少休","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"到旅店稍微休息後","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"Ｂ缺少或很少","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但少閑人如吾兩人耳","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只是缺少有閒情的人像我們兩人罷了","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"Ｃ小或年幼、年輕的","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"少負絕異之資","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"年少時就擁有超越一般人的資質","n":14,"ssz":".1......2....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"換你試試看！下面的每個句子都有「少」，請利用上表查找合適的意思，再將代號填入(  )中。","n":44,"ssz":"..........1.1.................2............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「少」不更事。","n":9,"ssz":".....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.陳涉「少」時，嘗(曾經)與人傭耕(替人種田)。","n":25,"ssz":".....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.聽僕(我)之所為，「少」安勿躁(不要急)。","n":23,"ssz":"..................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.兒(小時候)能騎羊，引(拉)弓射鳥鼠；「少」長(長大)則射狐兔。","n":34,"ssz":"..........................1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"5.遙知兄弟登高處，遍插茱萸「少」一人。","n":20,"ssz":"........1........2.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"6.濟從騎(隨從)有一馬，絕(非常)難乘，「少」能騎者。","n":28,"ssz":"..........2................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、文章重點表","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:keypoints.intro","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"<愛讀書的顧寧人>的課文內容寫的是一位愛讀書的人，「他的背景」、「他是怎麼樣的人」、「他做了什麼」的文章。這跟白話文的寫法是一樣的。\n讀文言文時，我們可以善用文章的結構來幫助我們讀文言文喔。我們一起根據寫人的結構，來整理文章重點。","n":115,"ssz":"....